to </span><span begin="01:01.070" end="01:01.460">me </span><span begin="01:01.460" end="01:03.260">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.710" end="01:06.680"><span begin="01:03.710" end="01:04.040">I </span><span begin="01:04.040" end="01:04.280">could </span><span begin="01:04.280" end="01:04.520">use </span><span begin="01:04.520" end="01:05.510">someone </span><span begin="01:05.510" end="01:06.080">like </span><span begin="01:06.080" end="01:06.680">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.520" end="01:14.930"><span begin="01:07.520" end="01:08.450">Someone </span><span begin="01:08.450" end="01:08.720">who'll </span><span begin="01:08.720" end="01:11.600">kill </span><span begin="01:11.600" end="01:11.930">on </span><span begin="01:11.930" end="01:12.530">my </span><span begin="01:12.530" end="01:14.930">command</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.230" end="01:19.130"><span begin="01:15.230" end="01:15.830">And </span><span begin="01:15.830" end="01:16.490">asks </span><span begin="01:16.490" end="01:16.790">no </span><span begin="01:16.790" end="01:17.390">questions</span><span begin="01:17.390" end="01:17.660">（</span><span begin="01:17.660" end="01:18.050">I'm </span><span begin="01:18.050" end="01:18.200">gonna </span><span begin="01:18.200" end="01:18.320">make </span><span begin="01:18.320" end="01:18.380">you</span><span begin="01:18.380" end="01:19.130">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.130" end="01:20.420"><span begin="01:19.130" end="01:19.220">I'm </span><span begin="01:19.220" end="01:19.610">gonna </span><span begin="01:19.610" end="01:20.180">break </span><span begin="01:20.180" end="01:20.420">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.420" end="01:22.490"><span begin="01:20.420" end="01:20.540">I'm </span><span begin="01:20.540" end="01:21.620">gonna </span><span begin="01:21.620" end="01:22.100">make </span><span begin="01:22.100" end="01:22.490">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.490" end="01:23.390"><span begin="01:22.490" end="01:22.580">A </span><span begin="01:22.580" end="01:22.630">*</span><span begin="01:22.630" end="01:22.680">*</span><span begin="01:22.680" end="01:22.730">*</span><span begin="01:22.730" end="01:22.780">*</span><span begin="01:22.780" end="01:22.830">*</span><span begin="01:22.830" end="01:22.880">*</span><span begin="01:22.880" end="01:22.970">* </span><span begin="01:22.970" end="01:23.390">psycho</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.390" end="01:23.900"><span begin="01:23.390" end="01:23.420">A </span><span begin="01:23.420" end="01:23.420">*</span><span begin="01:23.420" end="01:23.420">*</span><span begin="01:23.420" end="01:23.420">*</span><span begin="01:23.420" end="01:23.420">*</span><span begin="01:23.420" end="01:23.420">*</span><span begin="01:23.420" end="01:23.420">*</span><span begin="01:23.420" end="01:23.420">* </span><span begin="01:23.420" end="01:23.900">psycho</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.900" end="01:39.140"><span begin="01:23.900" end="01:23.930">A </span><span begin="01:23.930" end="01:26.040">*</span><span begin="01:26.040" end="01:28.150">*</span><span begin="01:28.150" end="01:30.260">*</span><span begin="01:30.260" end="01:32.370">*</span><span begin="01:32.370" end="01:34.480">*</span><span begin="01:34.480" end="01:36.590">*</span><span begin="01:36.590" end="01:38.750">* </span><span begin="01:38.750" end="01:39.140">psycho</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.650" end="01:47.510"><span begin="01:39.650" end="01:39.890">Your </span><span begin="01:39.890" end="01:42.200">ass </span><span begin="01:42.200" end="01:42.980">belongs </span><span begin="01:42.980" end="01:43.400">to </span><span begin="01:43.400" end="01:44.090">me </span><span begin="01:44.090" end="01:47.510">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.510" end="01:48.500"><span begin="01:47.510" end="01:47.690">Are </span><span begin="01:47.690" end="01:47.870">you </span><span begin="01:47.870" end="01:47.900">a </span><span begin="01:47.900" end="01:48.170">human </span><span begin="01:48.170" end="01:48.440">drone</span><span begin="01:48.440" end="01:48.500">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.500" end="01:49.280"><span begin="01:48.500" end="01:48.830">Aye</span><span begin="01:48.830" end="01:48.830">, </span><span begin="01:48.830" end="01:49.250">sir</span><span begin="01:49.250" end="01:49.280">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.280" end="01:50.510"><span begin="01:49.280" end="01:49.490">Are </span><span begin="01:49.490" end="01:49.640">you </span><span begin="01:49.640" end="01:49.730">a </span><span begin="01:49.730" end="01:50.030">killing </span><span begin="01:50.030" end="01:50.450">machine</span><span begin="01:50.450" end="01:50.510">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.510" end="01:51.470"><span begin="01:50.510" end="01:50.840">Aye</span><span begin="01:50.840" end="01:50.840">, </span><span begin="01:50.840" end="01:51.410">sir</span><span begin="01:51.410" end="01:51.470">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.470" end="01:54.140"><span begin="01:51.470" end="01:51.860">I'm </span><span begin="01:51.860" end="01:51.920">in </span><span begin="01:51.920" end="01:52.340">control</span><span begin="01:52.340" end="01:52.340">, </span><span begin="01:52.340" end="01:52.550">mother</span><span begin="01:52.550" end="01:52.610">*</span><span begin="01:52.610" end="01:52.670">*</span><span begin="01:52.670" end="01:52.730">*</span><span begin="01:52.730" end="01:52.790">*</span><span begin="01:52.790" end="01:52.850">*</span><span begin="01:52.850" end="01:52.910">*</span><span begin="01:52.910" end="01:52.970">, </span><span begin="01:52.970" end="01:53.240">do </span><span begin="01:53.240" end="01:53.390">you </span><span begin="01:53.390" end="01:54.110">understand</span><span begin="01:54.110" end="01:54.140">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.140" end="01:54.980"><span begin="01:54.140" end="01:54.500">Aye</span><span begin="01:54.500" end="01:54.500">, </span><span begin="01:54.500" end="01:54.950">sir</span><span begin="01:54.950" end="01:54.980">!</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.980" end="02:00.770"><span begin="01:54.980" end="01:55.160">Your </span><span begin="01:55.160" end="01:57.470">mind </span><span begin="01:57.470" end="01:58.010">is </span><span begin="01:58.010" end="01:58.490">just </span><span begin="01:58.490" end="01:58.670">a </span><span begin="01:58.670" end="02:00.770">program</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.640" end="02:05.420"><span begin="02:01.640" end="02:01.940">And </span><span begin="02:01.940" end="02:02.240">I'm </span><span begin="02:02.240" end="02:02.480">the </span><span begin="02:02.480" end="02:05.420">virus</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.450" end="02:08.690"><span begin="02:05.450" end="02:05.660">I'm </span><span begin="02:05.660" end="02:06.530">changing </span><span begin="02:06.530" end="02:06.650">the </span><span begin="02:06.650" end="02:08.690">station</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.020" end="02:11.210"><span begin="02:09.020" end="02:09.410">I'll </span><span begin="02:09.410" end="02:10.050">improve </span><span begin="02:10.050" end="02:10.230">your </span><span begin="02:10.230" end="02:11.210">thresholds</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.710" end="02:15.560"><span begin="02:12.710" end="02:12.920">I'll </span><span begin="02:12.920" end="02:13.250">turn </span><span begin="02:13.250" end="02:13.400">you </span><span begin="02:13.400" end="02:14.180">into </span><span begin="02:14.180" end="02:14.270">a </span><span begin="02:14.270" end="02:14.780">super </span><span begin="02:14.780" end="02:15.020">drone </span><span begin="02:15.020" end="02:15.320">super </span><span begin="02:15.320" end="02:15.560">drone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.760" end="02:24.080"><span begin="02:16.760" end="02:17.150">And </span><span begin="02:17.150" end="02:17.540">you </span><span begin="02:17.540" en